  "articleBody": "A dining room remodel should begin with how the room will be used, then connect layout, lighting, storage, finishes, and adjacent spaces into one construction plan. In San Diego County, moving walls or changing electrical, plumbing, or mechanical systems may affect permits and drawings, so compare contractors on design coordination, scope clarity, and preparation before signing.",
